        q: "What does car engine service include in Dubai?",
        a: "Engine service covers both routine maintenance and mechanical repairs. A routine service or tune-up involves scanning the engine management system, replacing spark plugs, changing air and fuel filters, and cleaning the throttle body. More extensive engine service includes timing belt or chain replacement, cylinder head gasket repair, resolving oil and coolant leaks, cooling system repairs, and complete engine overhauls or unit replacements when required."
